180
00:15:24,680 --> 00:15:28,350
Wow! Ryusuke-kun, you speak English!

181
00:15:28,350 --> 00:15:29,710
That's so cool!

182
00:15:29,710 --> 00:15:32,280
Yeah. I lived in New York for a long time.

183
00:15:32,280 --> 00:15:35,350
