234
00:20:49,030 --> 00:20:51,030
Umm...Ginger ale.

235
00:20:51,030 --> 00:20:52,330
Okay.

236
00:20:53,600 --> 00:20:57,640
Hey, Koyuki! Why'd you
run away the other day?!

237
00:20:57,640 --> 00:20:58,970
Sorry!

238
00:21:16,030 --> 00:21:17,990
